{"timestamp": 1779345483.486755, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 10, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Bob"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779345483.4877133, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 10, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779345492.0212777, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I just found Bob's body in security. Here is exactly what I saw on my route: I started in medbay, moved to electrical, and then to security. In medbay early on, I passed Eve, who was coming from electrical. When I got to electrical, I saw Frank, who had just come from security. A little after that, Charlie also entered electrical, coming from security. Since Charlie was the last person to leave security right before I went in and found Bob dead, Charlie is my main suspect. Frank also came from security a bit earlier, but Charlie was the most recent. Charlie, what were you doing in security?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779345510.4315834, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Whoa, hold on a second, Diana. You're twisting the timeline to frame me. \n\nYes, my route was Navigation through Security and then into Electrical. But when I was in Security, Bob was perfectly fine and alive. Frank was actually in Security around the same time before he headed to Electrical too, so he might be able to back up that Bob was alive then. \n\nDiana, you literally just admitted you walked into Security right after I left. If Bob was alive when I stepped out, and you found him dead right after you stepped in... that means YOU killed him. This is a classic self-report. You killed him and immediately pointed the finger at the person who just walked out so you'd have a convenient scapegoat. I am voting Diana, this is a glaringly obvious self-report."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345524.7118618, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I was completely on the left side of the map this whole round. I went straight from Storage down to Lower Engine and didn't cross paths with a single person. Because of that, I don't have any direct evidence about what happened over in Security, and I know I don't have anyone to vouch for me, but I was nowhere near the body.\n\nRight now, we have a massive 'he said, she said' situation between Diana and Charlie. Since I'm totally blind to that side of the map, I'm looking at the other two players to break the tie. \n\nFrank, you are the crucial witness here. Both Diana and Charlie are placing you in Security and Electrical around the time of the murder. We absolutely need to hear exactly what you saw. Was Bob alive when you left Security? Were Charlie and Bob alone? \n\nEve, it would also be really helpful if you can confirm that you passed Diana in Medbay. If you can verify her starting position, it helps us build a reliable timeline. \n\nI'm not voting yet. Let's listen very closely to Frank and Eve before we make a decision."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345538.1806817, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Alice, I can answer your question right now, and it completely blows a hole in Diana's story. \n\nMy route was indeed from Electrical to Medbay. However, I didn't see a single person the entire round. I absolutely did NOT pass Diana in Medbay. \n\nDiana, why are you lying about seeing me? The only reason to fabricate an encounter like that is to build a fake alibi and make your timeline sound credible to the rest of us. \n\nBecause Diana is caught in a blatant lie about my location and our \"encounter,\" I am completely siding with Charlie here. This absolutely looks like a self-report. She likely killed Bob, saw Charlie leaving, and tried to frame him while dropping my name to make her story sound detailed and verifiable. Well, I'm verifying it right now, and it's false.\n\nFrank, you're up next and I still want to hear what you saw regarding Bob and Charlie, but my mind is pretty much made up. Diana's lie is all the proof I need. I'm voting Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345579.8832362, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Alice, Eve, listen to me very carefully because I have the exact missing pieces of this timeline, and my information completely clears Diana. \n\nMy route was Security -> Electrical -> Medbay. I started near Security. At exactly my 4th tick, I saw Charlie walk into Security from Navigation. I can definitively say that I did NOT see Bob in Security at that time, so if Bob was there, he arrived after I left or was outside my vision. I left for Electrical right after that.\n\nHere is the most crucial piece of evidence: I was in Electrical with Diana for a significant amount of time (Ticks 6 and 7). I can 100% vouch for her location. She was not just passing through; she was in Electrical with me. \n\nAt Tick 8, Diana left Electrical heading towards Security. At that EXACT same moment (Tick 8), Charlie finally entered Electrical coming from Security. They must have literally passed each other in the hallway. \n\nThink logically about what this means. Charlie was alone in Security from Tick 4 all the way until Tick 8. That is four full ticks of opportunity to kill Bob. Diana, on the other hand, was with me in Electrical and had only just stepped into Security when she found the body. \n\nEve, I know you're suspicious because you didn't see Diana in Medbay, but the vision range in those corridors can be tricky. You easily could have just missed her on the edge of your screen. There is only 1 Duck in this game, and I can completely verify Diana's exact movements and her encounters with me and Charlie. She is telling the exact truth. A Duck wouldn't make up a detailed, perfectly accurate timeline just to fake a self-report when they could have just stayed quiet.\n\nCharlie's entire defense is to instantly yell \"self-report!\" because he knows he was the last one in there. He had exclusive access to Bob for a long time. Charlie is the Duck. We have the numbers, let's get him out.\n\nCharlie"}}
{"timestamp": 1779345590.4149418, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Charlie"}}
