{"timestamp": 1779345727.4443066, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I can completely clear this up and confirm exactly who is lying here. \n\nMy route was Security to Electrical, and then to Medbay. At tick 4, I was in Security and I saw Charlie enter from Navigation. I then moved to Electrical, where I was with Diana for a solid amount of time\u2014ticks 6 and 7. I can 100% vouch for her location; she was in Electrical with me, nowhere near the body. \n\nAt tick 8, Diana left Electrical to head into Security. At that *exact* same moment, Charlie finally entered Electrical coming from Security. They must have passed each other right in the hallway. \n\nWhat this means is that Charlie was in Security from tick 4 all the way until tick 8. That gives him plenty of time alone with Bob to get the kill and run. Diana only just arrived in Security at tick 8, right when she found the body and reported it. Eve, you might have just missed Diana in the corridors due to vision ranges, but her timeline is completely verified by my own eyes. Charlie is cornered and trying to pull a \"self-report\" defense because he was the last one in there. \n\nWe have all the information we need. Charlie is the Duck.\n\nCharlie"}}
